2120 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Led end\055to\055end product design for complex enterprise products\054 working closely with Product\054 Engineering\054 QA\054 and business stakeholders to frame problems\054 define workflows\054 align priorities\054 and deliver scalable solutions\056\n\nWatchTower \055 Real\055Time Anti\055Fraud Dashboard\nLed the end\055to\055end design of a real\055time fraud analytics product\054 from ambiguous business needs and problem framing through workflows\054 information architecture\054 data visualization\054 prototyping\054 and delivery\056\nFacilitated alignment across Product\054 Engineering\054 and business stakeholders to define scope\054 user needs\054 priorities\054 and success criteria\056\nDesigned investigation workflows and data\055dense interfaces supporting monitoring and analysis of 3M\053 fraud cases with near real\055time insights\056\nTranslated complex fraud signals and operational data into clear decision\055support experiences for fraud leadership and enterprise clients\056\nConnected product decisions to business goals including executive visibility\054 client demonstrations\054 customer retention\054 and commercial expansion\056\nImpact\072 Improved fraud visibility and reduced reliance on manual reporting\054 supporting enterprise demos\054 customer retention\054 and the successful renewal and expansion of a key B2B client contract\056\n\nCase Management System \050CMS\051 \055 Fraud \046 Chargeback Operations\nLed product design for a complex case management platform covering fraud and chargeback investigation workflows\056\nStructured ambiguous operational requirements into scalable information architecture\054 case workflows\054 tracking patterns\054 and investigation tools\056\nPartnered closely with Product and Engineering to negotiate workflow complexity\054 technical constraints\054 and delivery priorities\056\nDesigned reusable patterns that supported high\055volume operational workflows and more consistent case handling\056\n\nImpact\072 Centralized fraud and chargeback operations for 100\045 of GeoComply clients\054 making it a core offering and a key product within the Fraud domain\056 The platform improved investigation efficiency\054 reduced processing friction\054 and created a more structured and scalable operational workflow\056\n\nIDComply \055 Identity Verification Platform\nLed end\055to\055end product design for a cross\055platform identity verification experience across web and mobile\056\nSimplified complex verification journeys involving identity documents\054 selfie capture\054 guidance\054 validation\054 and real\055time feedback\056\nWorked with PMs and engineers to define user flows\054 resolve edge cases\054 align platform behavior\054 and maintain a consistent experience across markets\056\nDesigned solutions supporting expansion into the US\054 UK\054 Poland\054 Brazil\054 and Mexico\054 adapting experiences to different market and compliance requirements\056\nUsed research\054 usability considerations\054 product data\054 and iterative design to identify and resolve major user friction points\056\n\nImpact\072 Increased verification success rate by 50\045 and supported 20\045 user growth in the US\054 while enabling expansion into additional international markets\056\n\nDesign System \055 Enterprise Design Foundation\nLed the design and strategy of a cross\055platform design system\054 driving alignment across designers and engineers to define standards\054 components\054 patterns\054 and scalable foundations\056\nEstablished reusable UI components\054 patterns\054 and guidelines to ensure consistent and efficient experiences across multiple products and platforms\056\n\nImpact\072 Improved consistency and design\057development efficiency across 5\053 products\054 accelerating delivery and supporting scalable product development\056)
     /K [ 23 ]
     /P 2121 0 R
     /Pg 2076 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

