2128 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Led design direction across digital products\054 websites\054 recruitment platforms\054 branding\054 and regional experiences\056 Managed and mentored a design team while collaborating with business and cross\055functional stakeholders\056\n\nIconicjob\056vn \024 Recruitment Platform\nLed the redesign of the main recruitment platform\054 focusing on improving candidate journeys\054 information architecture\054 and recruitment workflows\056\nIdentified UX issues across complex recruitment flows and translated business requirements into clearer user experiences\056\nCollaborated with stakeholders to prioritize improvements based on user needs and business objectives\056\nImpact\072 Increased registrations by 3\054000\053 per month\056\n\nStartwith \046 Kensetsu Websites\nLed the logo\054 branding strategy\054 UX\054 and visual design for two new websites supporting expansion into new markets and services\056\nWorked with stakeholders to translate business positioning and service requirements into scalable digital experiences\056\nImpact\072 Supported market expansion\054 new services\054 and business growth Japan\056\n\nRegional Job Platforms\nMaintained and scaled recruitment platforms across 5 countries\054 ensuring consistent UX while adapting experiences to local market requirements\056\nEstablished reusable patterns and design practices to improve consistency across regional products\056\nImpact\072 served as the main recruitment platform for Japan\054 Malaysia\054 Indonesia\054 Singapore\054 supporting local hiring and business operations\056\n\nHR Consulting Website\nDesigned and launched the main website for a high\055end HR consulting service\056\nImpact\072 contributed to becoming the \0431 Japan\055focused HR consulting service in Vietnam\056\n\nTeam Management\nManaged and mentored 2 direct\055report designers\056\nProvided structured feedback on UX\054 UI quality\054 design process\054 and communication\056\nSupported designers in improving craft quality and creating more consistent design outcomes across projects\056)
     /K [ 27 ]
     /P 2129 0 R
     /Pg 2076 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
